# Phase C — Embedding Retrieval + RAG Chat
#
# We commit: scripts, REPORT, parsed game data, generated Q&A bank,
# and the small (16 MiB) embedding index so the chat works out of the
# box on clone. We exclude:
#   - Python cache + venv
#   - HuggingFace model cache (lives in ~/.cache/huggingface/)
#   - Fine-tuned model checkpoints (470 MB; user can re-train)
#   - Auto-derived FP16 variant (derivable from .npy)
#   - Eval CSV from sentence-transformers fit() (auto-regenerated)

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Fine-tune outputs — large, optional, regenerated by finetune_embedding.py
models/minilm_ft/
models/ft_train_log.json
models/Information-Retrieval_evaluation_*.csv
models/_bank_fp.json
models/embeddings.fp16.npy
